cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite both the software (this file) and the
  manuscript listed under references.
title: Pisot Substitution Conjecture Research Program
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research workspace for the balanced-pair and seed-patch overlap
  route to the Pisot Substitution Conjecture, in the non-unimodular primitive
  irreducible Pisot setting. Contains a canonical exact Mojo implementation,
  TLA+ dependency and state-machine models, Lean 4 proofs of the finite
  algebra, a Python reference oracle, and exact finite-domain certificates.
type: software
